# UI and styling

## Design tokens (Tailwind)

- **Colors** use slash notation from `tailwind.config.js`: `brand/700`, `gray/600`, `error/500`, etc.—not raw hex unless matching a one-off in an existing screen.
- **Shadows / focus**: e.g. `shadows/shadow-sm`, `focus-rings/ring-brand` where appropriate.
- **Breakpoints**: project defines `xs`, `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`, `2xl`, `3xl`—prefer `md:` for desktop split layouts (see Login).

## Typography

- Use **utility classes from `src/index.css` / `App.css`**: `display-xs-semibold`, `text-md-regular`, `text-sm-medium`, `text-sm-semibold`, etc. Do not default to raw `text-lg font-bold` if a display/text pair exists.

## Components

- Import primitives from **`@interstellar-component`** (`MyButton`, `MyTextField`, `MyCheckbox`, `MyLogo`, `MyStepper`, `MyStep`, …) instead of raw HTML for buttons/inputs when building app screens.
- **`MyButton`**: use props already used in repo: `color`, `variant`, `size`, `expanded`, `disabled`, `type="submit"` for primary actions.

## Layout patterns

- **Auth / marketing splits**: `flex h-screen`, form column `max-w-[360px]` or similar, decorative side `hidden md:flex` with rounded image container—align with `Login` / `Register`.
- **Multi-step registration**: purple sidebar `bg-brand/800`, `MyStepper` + `MyStep`, `activeStep` state in parent, content area in a sibling column.

## Accessibility

- Match existing patterns: keyboard handlers on icon toggles where `role="button"` is used; keep labels as visible `text-sm-medium text-gray-700` (or equivalent) above fields.
